The '''Poisoned Water Worm''' is a {{Rare}} [[Sea Creature]] that can be fished up in the {{Zone|Goblin Holdout}}.

== Spawning ==
The Poisoned Water Worm can be fished up from {{Item|Water}} in the {{Zone|Goblin Holdout}}. It can only be fished up if the player has {{Skl|Fishing|XVII}}. 

The base [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] for the '''Poisoned Water Worm''' is {{Green|300}}, resulting in a default catch chance of {{Chance|6.13%|1|16.32|sea creatures}} with all Sea Creatures unlocked. Certain modifiers can be used to increase it:
{| class="wikitable"
!Condition
!<span title="Stacks multiplicatively">Weight</span>
|-
|{{Item|Whale Bait}}, {{Item|Light Bait}}, and {{Item|Dark Bait}}
|{{Green|1.25x}}
